---
// the lede — name, position, actions, light metadata strip
---

<section class="hero">
  <div>
    <p class="hero__kicker reveal" style="--reveal-delay: 120ms;">
      Builder, Boulder, Colorado
    </p>

    <h1 class="hero__headline reveal" style="--reveal-delay: 220ms;">
      I build systems software and keep <em>a notebook</em> of the work.
    </h1>

    <p class="hero__lede reveal" style="--reveal-delay: 380ms;">
      I'm <strong>David Allen</strong>. I work on Go services, a Rust time-series
      database, agent orchestration, decentralized social, and the hardware that
      runs a flower farm. Six projects below. Build notes are
      <a class="link-inline" href="https://substack.com/@datariot">on Substack</a>.
    </p>

    <div class="hero__actions reveal" style="--reveal-delay: 600ms;">
      <a class="btn btn--primary" href="#projects">
        See the projects
        <span class="icon" aria-hidden="true">↓</span>
      </a>
      <a class="btn" href="https://substack.com/@datariot" rel="noopener">
        Read on Substack
        <span class="icon" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
      </a>
      <a class="btn" href="https://github.com/datariot" rel="noopener">
        GitHub
        <span class="icon" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
      </a>
    </div>

    <dl class="hero__strip reveal" style="--reveal-delay: 740ms;">
      <div class="hero__strip__item">
        <dt>Practice</dt>
        <dd>Systems software, agent infrastructure, hardware integrations.</dd>
      </div>
      <div class="hero__strip__item">
        <dt>Languages</dt>
        <dd>Go · Rust · TypeScript · the occasional shell.</dd>
      </div>
      <div class="hero__strip__item">
        <dt>Open for</dt>
        <dd>Work on tools for small technical teams.</dd>
      </div>
      <div class="hero__strip__item">
        <dt>Elsewhere</dt>
        <dd>
          <a class="link-inline" href="https://github.com/datariot">GitHub</a>
          &nbsp;·&nbsp;
          <a class="link-inline" href="https://substack.com/@datariot">Substack</a>
        </dd>
      </div>
    </dl>
  </div>
</section>
